# moe-phone patch for github.com/Helldez/BigMoeOnEdge @ 74ba18f, applied AFTER 0002 and 0003 (engine files only).
# --recycle-pages: an evicted expert slice's physical pages are parked and mremap-moved under the next miss's slot,
# instead of MADV_DONTNEED + first-touch zero-fill faults per 4 KB. Parked slots are tracked per entry and reused in place.
